# Night-school corridor tileset, side view. 16x16 tiles.
# Solid: floor_*, ceiling. One-way: shelf, desk. Background: wall_*,
# window_*, door_*. Props go on a layer above the wall.
# Multi-tile pieces are named NAME_x_y by tile position.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/tiles_night_school.png
@preview ../previews/tiles_night_school_x4.png 4
@columns 8

